      "value": "@{60bfb6cb2becb31082691a45|full_name}: I’m having the EXACT same issue you’re having. It’s bull shit.\nI’ve got no idea how to fix it, but I’ve tried wiping vrchat and even steam vr entirely off my pc and it hasn’t worked. According to previous issues like this, the devs before have said they don’t know why this happens and say it’s an issue with steam vr. I’ve put in a report to steam vr to get this dealt with and they dont understand the situation yet.\nWhenever I lost finger tracking before the update, it was because I opened vrchat through my browser rather than steam vr. Now because of EAC, the game is always launched through my browser because EAC forces it to, so I have a feeling that it’s related to how the game is launched.\nAlso, just to make sure, does the image in the steam vr menu for vrchat turn grey when the game loads in for you?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
