      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The in game menu still works for the A button, but Muting and Jumping (or any bound button outside of the menu) does not work. So you can still move the big menu around with your A buttons, and see them work in the controller menu, but in the actual game, no work. \n\nI would also clarify that it's not just the gestures, it's the entire finger tracking that stops working as well. thumbs register, but all other fingers are fully extended and do not track. \n\nFinally, the only fix I can find for this is to Clear cache, uninstall, restart PC, and reinstall. but this is happening to me almost ever night now. \n\nHopefully this bug is a bit more well known, but it dosen't seem that way.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
